    Bug 2030280 - Tests part 1: Change an item's ID when moving it in the mock Exchange server. r=edicharry


    I pondered for a bit on whether this was necessary as I started working on
    testing message move with Graph, and I opted for going the extra mile to make
    sure our mock test server behaved as closely to the real thing as possible.

    This turned out to be a bit of a rabbit hole, which is why some changes might
    seem unrelated at first; for instance the "flattening" of changes which is due
    to a test suddenly failing because it was accidentally relying on a new message
    being created with the same ID as one that had just been removed.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294157

